  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 1.74,
      "text": "This bumblebee is rolling a wooden"
    },
    {
      "start": 1.74,
      "end": 4.0,
      "text": "ball. There is no nectar inside."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.260000000000001,
      "end": 5.6000000000000005,
      "text": "So why does it keep rolling?"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.896,
      "end": 7.816,
      "text": "In a laboratory, researchers gave"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.816,
      "end": 9.596,
      "text": "bees a clear route to food,"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.736,
      "end": 11.196000000000002,
      "text": "with wooden balls placed off to"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.196000000000002,
      "end": 11.796,
      "text": "the sides."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.112,
      "end": 13.792,
      "text": "The bees could walk straight past."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.172,
      "end": 15.952,
      "text": "But many stopped, climbed onto"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.172,
      "end": 17.292,
      "text": "movable balls, and rolled them"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.292,
      "end": 17.772,
      "text": "anyway."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.114666666666665,
      "end": 19.914666666666665,
      "text": "Some rolled again and again, even"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.914666666666665,
      "end": 22.194666666666663,
      "text": "after feeding. The balls offered no"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.194666666666663,
      "end": 23.914666666666665,
      "text": "sugar or pollen reward."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.223999999999997,
      "end": 26.063999999999997,
      "text": "In a separate test, young bees"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.063999999999997,
      "end": 27.983999999999995,
      "text": "rolled more often than older bees"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.983999999999995,
      "end": 29.223999999999997,
      "text": "that were equally new to the"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.223999999999997,
      "end": 29.683999999999997,
      "text": "balls."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.991999999999997,
      "end": 31.731999999999996,
      "text": "Another test offered different"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.752,
      "end": 33.812,
      "text": "coloured chambers. Bees later chose"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.812,
      "end": 35.471999999999994,
      "text": "more often the colour linked to"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.471999999999994,
      "end": 36.552,
      "text": "earlier ball rolling."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.82666666666666,
      "end": 38.42666666666666,
      "text": "That suggests the activity itself"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.42666666666666,
      "end": 40.44666666666666,
      "text": "was rewarding, even without an"
    },
    {
      "start": 40.44666666666666,
      "end": 41.36666666666666,
      "text": "edible prize."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.71999999999999,
      "end": 43.57999999999999,
      "text": "The researchers called it play-like"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.55999999999999,
      "end": 45.75999999999999,
      "text": "behaviour. Yet a laboratory test"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.75999999999999,
      "end": 47.57999999999999,
      "text": "cannot directly reveal how bees"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.57999999999999,
      "end": 49.77999999999999,
      "text": "feel, or how often wild bees"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.77999999999999,
      "end": 50.459999999999994,
      "text": "do this."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.66666666666666,
      "end": 52.426666666666655,
      "text": "An insect rolling a ball may"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.426666666666655,
      "end": 53.80666666666666,
      "text": "be showing us that play has"
    },
    {
      "start": 53.80666666666666,
      "end": 56.106666666666655,
      "text": "more forms than we usually notice."
    }
  ],
